    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/c68be66fced68ee9da05b8992ce9c4a9.poster.avif?t=1753853555\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/c68be66fced68ee9da05b8992ce9c4a9.webm?t=1753853555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/c68be66fced68ee9da05b8992ce9c4a9.mp4?t=1753853555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2>Once a prominent streamer, you're now unemployed and drowning in financial troubles\u2014until a lifeline suddenly appears: Akari, the youngest daughter of a prestigious local family, has one goal\u2014getting into a top-tier university\u2014and she's in desperate need of a private tutor.This is your chance! <br><br>Your new job comes with an invitation to move into her family's opulent mansion, where you'll share a roof with four uniquely charming women. It sounds like the perfect escape from your current struggles... but appearances can be deceiving. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akari's crucial exam is only 30 days away. The pressure is relentless and every moment counts. You\u2019ll need to manage your time and energy carefully, as you unravel the secrets hidden within the lives of your new housemates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >......which, of course, includes a healthy dose of naughty secrets!Tread carefully and don't get caught! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/83a850a052382581d093420586b19700.poster.avif?t=1753853555\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/83a850a052382581d093420586b19700.webm?t=1753853555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/83a850a052382581d093420586b19700.mp4?t=1753853555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/1c085114d7bbf8c52fdf760df7142cf8.avif?t=1753853555\" width=616 height=312 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/7f252026b1f36c009ded54d26b222a90.avif?t=1753853555\" width=616 height=312 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/9d0a69a022b4cd09a88781b0b0c6cfb2.avif?t=1753853555\" width=616 height=312 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/93f74a6f13f77045201759c3cd5ab1f3.avif?t=1753853555\" width=616 height=312 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive full 3D experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese &amp; English Voices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15+ CGs- View H-scenes the way you like, from any angle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple and intuitive interface, to help you focus on your lessons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207780/extras/1fa6d925835f0eddd8a9ada9bdffd2f6.avif?t=1753853555\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://share